//~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
//
// ### ElementalUpgrade::MasteryPentagramUpgrade::Rate ### - ElementalUpgrade.txt, section 0
//	Mastery: Mastery grade of the source pentagram, 0 - regular pentagram
//	SuccessRateLvX: Upgrade success rate for source pentagram level X (0-15), n/100
//~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
//~~ 0 - the client does not accept the pentagram at that level
//~~ The client takes rows by position (row = Mastery), keep the order of section 0
//~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
//
// ### ElementalUpgrade::MasteryPentagramUpgrade::Pentagram ### - ElementalUpgrade.txt, section 1
//	Cat: Category of source pentagram
//	Index: Index of source pentagram
//	ItemCatX: Material item category (1-4)
//	ItemIndexX: Material item index (1-4)
//	ItemCountX: Material item count (1-4)
//	ResultCat: Category of result Mastery Pentagram
//	ResultIndex: Index of result Mastery Pentagram
//~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
//~~ Material 1 goes to the emblem slot, materials 2-4 to the three material slots
//~~ The emblem slot holds a single item, ItemCount1 above 1 works only for a stackable emblem
//~~ The client finds the row by Index only, Cat is not checked
//~~ Columns 1, 16, 19, 20 and 21 of section 1 are used neither by the client nor by the server
//~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
//
// ### ElementalUpgrade::MasteryErrtelUpgrade ### - Mastery Errtel Upgrade, Adniel NPC
