//	Rank: Rank of the source Errtel, -1 - any rank
//	SuccessRateLvX: Upgrade success rate for source Errtel level X (0-10), n/100
//~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
//~~ 0 - the client does not accept the Errtel at that level
//~~ The client takes rows by position (row = 3 * Mastery + Rank - 1), keep the order of section 2
//~~ Ranks 4 and 5 need the same rows in ElementalUpgrade.txt, the client refuses them otherwise
//~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
//
// ### ElementalUpgrade::MasteryErrtelUpgrade::Errtel ### - ElementalUpgrade.txt, section 3
//	Cat: Category of source Errtel
//	Index: Index of source Errtel
