//	ItemIndexX: Material item index (1-4)
//	ItemCountX: Material item count (1-4)
//	ResultCat: Category of result Mastery Errtel
//	ResultIndex: Index of result Mastery Errtel
//~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
//~~ Material 1 goes to the emblem slot, materials 2-4 to the three material slots
//~~ The emblem slot holds a single item, ItemCount1 above 1 works only for a stackable emblem
//~~ Only Errtels listed here can be put into the upgrade window
